{"seq":2,"slug":"v8-engine-and-libuv","title":"V8 引擎与 libuv","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/nodejs-and-npm/runtime-fundamentals/v8-engine-and-libuv","wordCount":1343,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"v8-引擎与-libuv\">V8 引擎与 libuv</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Node.js 的高性能来自两个 C++ 组件各司其职：<strong>V8 负责让 JavaScript 跑得快，libuv 负责让等待不占用线程</strong>。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>两阶段编译</strong>：Ignition 先生成字节码保证启动速度，TurboFan 再对热点函数深度优化——因此让热路径保持类型稳定是性能关键。</li>\n<li><strong>隐藏类与内联缓存</strong>：V8 按属性初始化顺序生成隐藏类，只有同形状的对象才能共享内联缓存；打乱初始化顺序会退化属性访问速度。</li>\n<li><strong>分代式 GC</strong>：新生代用 Scavenge（复制算法，频繁触发），老生代用 Mark-Sweep-Compact（触发较少），堆上限可用 <code>--max-old-space-size</code> 调整。</li>\n<li><strong>libuv 的分流策略</strong>：网络 I/O 交给操作系统的异步 API（epoll/kqueue/IOCP），文件、DNS、加密、压缩交给固定大小的线程池（默认 4，由 <code>UV_THREADPOOL_SIZE</code> 调整）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>二者的协作路径是 JS → C++ Binding → libuv → 结果回到事件队列 → 事件循环在合适阶段执行回调。这条链既解释了 I/O 为何&quot;异步非阻塞&quot;，也解释了线程池大小为何会成为并发 I/O 的隐藏瓶颈。</p>\n<h2 id=\"v8-引擎概述\">V8 引擎概述</h2><p>V8 是 Google 开发的高性能 JavaScript 和 WebAssembly 引擎，最初为 Chrome 浏览器设计，后被 Node.js 采用作为其 JavaScript 执行引擎。V8 将 JavaScript 代码直接编译为机器码，而非解释执行，这是 Node.js 能够实现高性能的关键因素之一。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    SOURCE[JavaScript 源代码] --&gt; PARSER[Parser 解析器]&#10;    PARSER --&gt; AST[AST 抽象语法树]&#10;    AST --&gt; IGNITION[Ignition 解释器&lt;br/&gt;生成字节码]&#10;    IGNITION --&gt; BYTECODE[字节码执行]&#10;    BYTECODE --&gt; PROFILE{热点代码检测}&#10;    PROFILE --&gt;|冷代码| BYTECODE&#10;    PROFILE --&gt;|热代码| TURBOFAN[TurboFan 优化编译器]&#10;    TURBOFAN --&gt; OPTIMIZED[优化后的机器码]&#10;    OPTIMIZED --&gt; DEOPT{类型假设失败?}&#10;    DEOPT --&gt;|是| BYTECODE&#10;    DEOPT --&gt;|否| OPTIMIZED\">flowchart TD\n    SOURCE[JavaScript 源代码] --&gt; PARSER[Parser 解析器]\n    PARSER --&gt; AST[AST 抽象语法树]\n    AST --&gt; IGNITION[Ignition 解释器&lt;br/&gt;生成字节码]\n    IGNITION --&gt; BYTECODE[字节码执行]\n    BYTECODE --&gt; PROFILE{热点代码检测}\n    PROFILE --&gt;|冷代码| BYTECODE\n    PROFILE --&gt;|热代码| TURBOFAN[TurboFan 优化编译器]\n    TURBOFAN --&gt; OPTIMIZED[优化后的机器码]\n    OPTIMIZED --&gt; DEOPT{类型假设失败?}\n    DEOPT --&gt;|是| BYTECODE\n    DEOPT --&gt;|否| OPTIMIZED</pre><h3 id=\"编译管线\">编译管线</h3><p>V8 使用两阶段编译策略，兼顾启动速度和运行性能：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>阶段</th>\n<th>引擎</th>\n<th>特点</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>第一阶段</td>\n<td>Ignition</td>\n<td>快速生成字节码，启动延迟低</td>\n<td>所有代码首次执行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>第二阶段</td>\n<td>TurboFan</td>\n<td>深度优化，生成高效机器码</td>\n<td>反复执行的热点代码</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function add(a: number, b: number): number {&#10;  return a + b;&#10;}&#10;&#10;for (let i = 0; i &lt; 100000; i++) {&#10;  add(i, i + 1);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> add</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">a</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">b</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> a </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> b;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 100000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; i</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  add</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(i, i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>上述 <code>add</code> 函数在被调用数千次后，V8 会将其标记为&quot;热点函数&quot;，由 TurboFan 编译为高度优化的机器码。TurboFan 会基于观察到的类型信息做出假设（如&quot;参数总是 number&quot;），据此进行优化。</p>\n<h3 id=\"隐藏类与内联缓存\">隐藏类与内联缓存</h3><p>V8 通过**隐藏类（Hidden Classes）<strong>和</strong>内联缓存（Inline Caches）**来加速属性访问：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"class Point {&#10;  x: number;&#10;  y: number;&#10;&#10;  constructor(x: number, y: number) {&#10;    this.x = x;&#10;    this.y = y;&#10;  }&#10;}&#10;&#10;const p1 = new Point(1, 2);&#10;const p2 = new Point(3, 4);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Point</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  x</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  y</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  constructor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">x</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">y</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.x </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> x;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.y </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> y;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> p1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Point</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> p2</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Point</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p>当 p1 和 p2 以相同的顺序初始化相同的属性时，V8 会为它们分配相同的隐藏类。后续访问 <code>p.x</code> 时，V8 可以通过内联缓存直接定位属性的内存偏移量，速度接近 C++ 结构体的属性访问。</p>\n<p>反模式——破坏隐藏类的行为：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const obj1: Record&lt;string, number&gt; = {};&#10;obj1.a = 1;&#10;obj1.b = 2;&#10;&#10;const obj2: Record&lt;string, number&gt; = {};&#10;obj2.b = 2;&#10;obj2.a = 1;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> obj1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Record</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">obj1.a </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">obj1.b </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> obj2</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Record</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">obj2.b </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">obj2.a </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>虽然 obj1 和 obj2 最终拥有相同的属性，但由于赋值顺序不同，V8 会为它们创建不同的隐藏类，导致无法共享内联缓存优化。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"v8-内存管理\">V8 内存管理</h2><p>V8 的垃圾回收器使用分代式策略，将堆内存分为新生代和老生代：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    subgraph 堆内存&#10;        subgraph 新生代[&quot;新生代 (Young Generation)&quot;]&#10;            SEMI1[Semi-Space A&lt;br/&gt;活跃区]&#10;            SEMI2[Semi-Space B&lt;br/&gt;空闲区]&#10;        end&#10;        subgraph 老生代[&quot;老生代 (Old Generation)&quot;]&#10;            OLD[老生代空间&lt;br/&gt;长期存活的对象]&#10;        end&#10;    end&#10;    SEMI1 --&gt;|Scavenge GC&lt;br/&gt;存活对象复制| SEMI2&#10;    SEMI1 --&gt;|晋升条件满足| OLD&#10;    OLD --&gt;|Mark-Sweep-Compact| OLD\">graph TB\n    subgraph 堆内存\n        subgraph 新生代[\"新生代 (Young Generation)\"]\n            SEMI1[Semi-Space A&lt;br/&gt;活跃区]\n            SEMI2[Semi-Space B&lt;br/&gt;空闲区]\n        end\n        subgraph 老生代[\"老生代 (Old Generation)\"]\n            OLD[老生代空间&lt;br/&gt;长期存活的对象]\n        end\n    end\n    SEMI1 --&gt;|Scavenge GC&lt;br/&gt;存活对象复制| SEMI2\n    SEMI1 --&gt;|晋升条件满足| OLD\n    OLD --&gt;|Mark-Sweep-Compact| OLD</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>区域</th>\n<th>大小</th>\n<th>GC 算法</th>\n<th>触发频率</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>新生代</td>\n<td>1-8 MB</td>\n<td>Scavenge（复制算法）</td>\n<td>频繁</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>老生代</td>\n<td>默认 ~1.4 GB (64位)</td>\n<td>Mark-Sweep-Compact</td>\n<td>较少</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>可以通过启动参数调整内存限制：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"import v8 from &#39;node:v8&#39;;&#10;&#10;const heapStats = v8.getHeapStatistics();&#10;const heapInfo = {&#10;  totalHeapSize: `${(heapStats.total_heap_size / 1024 / 1024).toFixed(2)} MB`,&#10;  usedHeapSize: `${(heapStats.used_heap_size / 1024 / 1024).toFixed(2)} MB`,&#10;  heapSizeLimit: `${(heapStats.heap_size_limit / 1024 / 1024).toFixed(2)} MB`,&#10;  externalMemory: `${(heapStats.external_memory / 1024 / 1024).toFixed(2)} MB`,&#10;};&#10;&#10;console.table(heapInfo);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> v8 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'node:v8'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> heapStats</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> v8.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getHeapStatistics</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> heapInfo</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  totalHeapSize: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`${</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">(</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">heapStats</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">total_heap_size</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1024</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1024</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">toFixed</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">)</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">} MB`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  usedHeapSize: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`${</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">(</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">heapStats</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">used_heap_size</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1024</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1024</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">toFixed</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">)</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">} MB`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  heapSizeLimit: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`${</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">(</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">heapStats</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">heap_size_limit</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1024</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1024</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">toFixed</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">)</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">} MB`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  externalMemory: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`${</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">(</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">heapStats</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">external_memory</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1024</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1024</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">toFixed</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">)</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">} MB`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">table</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(heapInfo);</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"libuv-的角色与架构\">libuv 的角色与架构</h2><p>libuv 是一个跨平台的异步 I/O 库，为 Node.js 提供了事件循环和异步操作的底层实现。它封装了不同操作系统的异步 I/O 机制（Linux 的 epoll、macOS 的 kqueue、Windows 的 IOCP）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    subgraph libuv&#10;        EL[事件循环]&#10;        TP[线程池&lt;br/&gt;默认 4 个线程]&#10;        subgraph 异步I/O&#10;            EPOLL[epoll&lt;br/&gt;Linux]&#10;            KQUEUE[kqueue&lt;br/&gt;macOS/BSD]&#10;            IOCP[IOCP&lt;br/&gt;Windows]&#10;        end&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 操作类型&#10;        NET[网络 I/O&lt;br/&gt;TCP/UDP/DNS] --&gt; EL&#10;        FS[文件系统操作] --&gt; TP&#10;        CRYPTO[加密操作] --&gt; TP&#10;        ZLIB_OP[压缩操作] --&gt; TP&#10;        DNS_OP[DNS 查询] --&gt; TP&#10;    end&#10;    EL --&gt; EPOLL&#10;    EL --&gt; KQUEUE&#10;    EL --&gt; IOCP\">graph TB\n    subgraph libuv\n        EL[事件循环]\n        TP[线程池&lt;br/&gt;默认 4 个线程]\n        subgraph 异步I/O\n            EPOLL[epoll&lt;br/&gt;Linux]\n            KQUEUE[kqueue&lt;br/&gt;macOS/BSD]\n            IOCP[IOCP&lt;br/&gt;Windows]\n        end\n    end\n    subgraph 操作类型\n        NET[网络 I/O&lt;br/&gt;TCP/UDP/DNS] --&gt; EL\n        FS[文件系统操作] --&gt; TP\n        CRYPTO[加密操作] --&gt; TP\n        ZLIB_OP[压缩操作] --&gt; TP\n        DNS_OP[DNS 查询] --&gt; TP\n    end\n    EL --&gt; EPOLL\n    EL --&gt; KQUEUE\n    EL --&gt; IOCP</pre><p>关键区分——libuv 对不同类型操作的处理方式：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>操作类型</th>\n<th>处理方式</th>\n<th>原因</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>TCP/UDP 网络 I/O</td>\n<td>操作系统异步 I/O</td>\n<td>所有主流操作系统都提供高效的网络异步 API</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>文件系统操作</td>\n<td>线程池</td>\n<td>大多数操作系统的文件 I/O API 是阻塞的</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DNS 查询</td>\n<td>线程池</td>\n<td>getaddrinfo 是阻塞调用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>加密/压缩</td>\n<td>线程池</td>\n<td>CPU 密集型，避免阻塞事件循环</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"线程池配置\">线程池配置</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const UV_THREADPOOL_SIZE = process.env.UV_THREADPOOL_SIZE || &#39;4&#39;;&#10;&#10;console.log(`libuv 线程池大小: ${UV_THREADPOOL_SIZE}`);&#10;&#10;import crypto from &#39;node:crypto&#39;;&#10;&#10;const NUM_HASHES = 8;&#10;const start = Date.now();&#10;&#10;for (let i = 0; i &lt; NUM_HASHES; i++) {&#10;  crypto.pbkdf2(&#39;password&#39;, &#39;salt&#39;, 100000, 64, &#39;sha512&#39;, () =&gt; {&#10;    const elapsed = Date.now() - start;&#10;    console.log(`Hash ${i + 1} 完成: ${elapsed}ms`);&#10;  });&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> UV_THREADPOOL_SIZE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> process.env.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">UV_THREADPOOL_SIZE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ||</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '4'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`libuv 线程池大小: ${</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">UV_THREADPOOL_SIZE</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> crypto </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'node:crypto'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> NUM_HASHES</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 8</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> start</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Date.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> NUM_HASHES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; i</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  crypto.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pbkdf2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'password'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'salt'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">64</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'sha512'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> elapsed</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Date.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> start;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`Hash ${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">i</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> +</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">} 完成: ${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">elapsed</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}ms`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>当线程池大小为 4（默认值），同时发起 8 个 pbkdf2 操作时，前 4 个会几乎同时完成，后 4 个在第二批完成——清晰展现了线程池的排队行为。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"v8-与-libuv-的协作\">V8 与 libuv 的协作</h2><p>V8 和 libuv 之间的协作通过 Node.js 的 C++ Binding 层实现：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant JS as JavaScript 代码&#10;    participant V8 as V8 引擎&#10;    participant BIND as C++ Binding&#10;    participant UV as libuv&#10;&#10;    JS-&gt;&gt;V8: fs.readFile(&#39;data.txt&#39;, callback)&#10;    V8-&gt;&gt;BIND: 调用 C++ 绑定函数&#10;    BIND-&gt;&gt;UV: uv_fs_read (提交到线程池)&#10;    Note over UV: 工作线程执行阻塞读取&#10;    UV--&gt;&gt;BIND: 读取完成,结果放入事件队列&#10;    Note over V8: 事件循环 Poll 阶段&#10;    BIND--&gt;&gt;V8: 将结果封装为 JS 对象&#10;    V8--&gt;&gt;JS: 执行 callback(null, data)\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant JS as JavaScript 代码\n    participant V8 as V8 引擎\n    participant BIND as C++ Binding\n    participant UV as libuv\n\n    JS-&gt;&gt;V8: fs.readFile('data.txt', callback)\n    V8-&gt;&gt;BIND: 调用 C++ 绑定函数\n    BIND-&gt;&gt;UV: uv_fs_read (提交到线程池)\n    Note over UV: 工作线程执行阻塞读取\n    UV--&gt;&gt;BIND: 读取完成,结果放入事件队列\n    Note over V8: 事件循环 Poll 阶段\n    BIND--&gt;&gt;V8: 将结果封装为 JS 对象\n    V8--&gt;&gt;JS: 执行 callback(null, data)</pre><p>理解这个流程后，就能解释为什么 Node.js 的 I/O 操作是&quot;异步非阻塞&quot;的：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>JavaScript 调用 I/O API，V8 将请求转交给 C++ 层</li>\n<li>C++ 层通过 libuv 将操作提交到线程池或操作系统异步 API</li>\n<li>主线程（事件循环）继续处理其他任务</li>\n<li>当 I/O 完成时，结果被放入事件队列</li>\n<li>事件循环在合适的阶段取出结果，执行回调</li>\n</ol>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"性能优化建议\">性能优化建议</h2><p>基于对 V8 和 libuv 的理解，以下是实践中的性能优化建议：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function performanceGuidelines(): Record&lt;string, string&gt; {&#10;  return {&#10;    保持对象形状一致: &#39;确保同类对象以相同顺序初始化相同属性，利用隐藏类优化&#39;,&#10;    避免多态函数: &#39;让函数参数类型保持一致，帮助 TurboFan 做类型特化&#39;,&#10;    调整线程池大小: &#39;根据并发 I/O 需求设置 UV_THREADPOOL_SIZE（最大 1024）&#39;,&#10;    监控堆内存: &#39;使用 v8.getHeapStatistics() 监控内存使用，必要时调整 --max-old-space-size&#39;,&#10;    避免内存泄漏: &#39;注意闭包引用、全局变量、未清理的事件监听器和定时器&#39;,&#10;    &#39;使用 Buffer 池&#39;: &#39;Buffer.allocUnsafe() 复用预分配内存，避免频繁分配和回收&#39;,&#10;  };&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> performanceGuidelines</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Record</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    保持对象形状一致: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'确保同类对象以相同顺序初始化相同属性，利用隐藏类优化'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    避免多态函数: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'让函数参数类型保持一致，帮助 TurboFan 做类型特化'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    调整线程池大小: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'根据并发 I/O 需求设置 UV_THREADPOOL_SIZE（最大 1024）'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    监控堆内存: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'使用 v8.getHeapStatistics() 监控内存使用，必要时调整 --max-old-space-size'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    避免内存泄漏: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'注意闭包引用、全局变量、未清理的事件监听器和定时器'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    '使用 Buffer 池'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Buffer.allocUnsafe() 复用预分配内存，避免频繁分配和回收'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>V8 引擎使用 Ignition + TurboFan 两阶段编译策略，兼顾启动速度和峰值性能。</li>\n<li>隐藏类和内联缓存是 V8 加速属性访问的核心机制，编写&quot;V8 友好&quot;的代码至关重要。</li>\n<li>V8 采用分代式垃圾回收：新生代使用 Scavenge，老生代使用 Mark-Sweep-Compact。</li>\n<li>libuv 为 Node.js 提供跨平台的异步 I/O 能力，网络 I/O 使用操作系统异步 API，文件 I/O 使用线程池。</li>\n<li>默认线程池大小为 4，可通过 UV_THREADPOOL_SIZE 环境变量调整。</li>\n<li>V8 和 libuv 通过 C++ Binding 层协作，共同实现了 Node.js 的异步非阻塞 I/O 模型。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"V8 引擎与 libuv","id":"v8-引擎与-libuv"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"V8 引擎概述","id":"v8-引擎概述"},{"level":3,"text":"编译管线","id":"编译管线"},{"level":3,"text":"隐藏类与内联缓存","id":"隐藏类与内联缓存"},{"level":2,"text":"V8 内存管理","id":"v8-内存管理"},{"level":2,"text":"libuv 的角色与架构","id":"libuv-的角色与架构"},{"level":3,"text":"线程池配置","id":"线程池配置"},{"level":2,"text":"V8 与 libuv 的协作","id":"v8-与-libuv-的协作"},{"level":2,"text":"性能优化建议","id":"性能优化建议"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Node.js 架构与事件循环","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/nodejs-and-npm/runtime-fundamentals/node-architecture-and-event-loop"},"next":{"title":"模块系统：CommonJS 与 ESM","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/nodejs-and-npm/runtime-fundamentals/modules-commonjs-and-esm"}}